  - Course Manager / Bypass Roles: additional controls to bypass mark entry or share snapshots via `admin/bypass` pages

Roles uses & controls (summary):
- `student`:
  - Use: view marks, check cycle performance, see exam-level status and donut score
  - Controls: cannot edit marks; visibility may be gated by profile completeness (profile photo/mobile) and publish flags
- `faculty`:
  - Use: view assigned courses, enter marks, view result analysis, export CO summary, manage LCA workflows
  - Controls: can edit marks for assigned courses and exams; some edits require approval (sent to ApprovalInbox)
- `admin`:
  - Use: manage exams, publish cycles, set weightage, approve faculty edits, run Google Sheets sync
  - Controls: can publish or unpublish marks, modify weightage and patterns, and access all student/faculty data
- `course_manager` / `bypass`:
  - Use: manage special bypass cases, share bypassed snapshots
  - Controls: create bypass sessions and share them; internal mark bypass flows

